rew at a time. You'll clear the stage once all the screws have been removed, and all the parts have fallen. Enjoy a peaceful puzzle experience while relaxing music plays.\n", "short_description": "Have relaxing fun as you navigate a world of screw pin, nuts and bolts puzzles!\nUnscrew the screws, and set your mind free. A relaxing puzzle experience.\n"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://newstory-inc.com/privacypolicy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "New Story Inc", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://newstory-inc.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "377978390272490"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED_FOR_DOWNLOAD", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "9627751170586189"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391878_1604298343625940_5513109303759893023_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=R2LrHvKUCWsQ7kNvwG2l_Zp&_nc_oc=Adp4La5hrLdzIik2N1xZkwmDoqgt702mJ0QPBM4Nv6guRWYbN913AhqbVpepEDf1__g&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af7K1FMitONDxZIYAFP_Vg9LywXaODtnbu-OREYw05edKA&oe=6A01C367"}, "is_concept": false, "is_test": false, "is_trial_offer_valid": false, "display_name": "Screw Puzzle:Happy Jam", "platform": "ANDROID_6DOF", "context_category": {"context_category": "GAMES", "id": "2743326035925534"}, "context_topics": [{"topic_name": 